      <title>700吉瓦幽灵用电：美国AI数据中心抢电闹剧已失控</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260902/700%E5%90%89%E7%93%A6%E5%B9%BD%E7%81%B5%E7%94%A8%E7%94%B5%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BDAI%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83%E6%8A%A2%E7%94%B5%E9%97%B9%E5%89%A7%E5%B7%B2%E5%A4%B1%E6%8E%A7/</link>
